Using demonic forces you create a link of pain from a source creature to a victim for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

Each time the source creature takes damage the victim takes [33%, 51%, 62%, 69%, 74% (TL1-5)] of the damage.

If the victim dies from the effect you gain a burst of energy, reducing all remaining cooldowns by 1.
